{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國一艘正進行預計超過3年環球航程的豪華郵輪，因面臨極其高昂燃油成本，周二（27日）宣布停航，導致約200名乘客滯留柬埔寨。</p><p>營運商表示，正與乘客協調離船計劃及臨時住宿安排。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T05:41:45.405424+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":87,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T05:26:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T05:18:16.328545+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T05:38:15.988486+00:00","content_hash":"08b2fd7f9664b6d0a85fcd91ba127c72075922daed12082154a0918ce9c50978","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}